<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>PI Bag</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>pistore &lt;item&gt;
piunstore &lt;item&gt;
<a cmd='#'>pilist</a>
</pre>
<p>A PI bag stores your Power Items without taking up room in your inventory, and 
keeps them when you're not carrying them. You can only use it once you have 
one; ask an administrator about it.
</p>
<ul><li><b>pistore &lt;item&gt;</b>: put one of your Power Items in the bag.</li>
<li><b>piunstore &lt;item&gt;</b>: take it out again.</li>
<li><b>pilist</b>: see what's in the bag.</li></ul>
<p>Only your own Power Items go in the bag. Don't try to store anything else: a 
Power Item that isn't yours is destroyed, and the administrators are told. You 
can't use the bag while you are dead.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Power Items</a>
</pre>




</div>